# The programs skwir's macOS package carries (tools/package/macos.sh,
# ADR-075): skwir, the helpers that link no library the bundle would
# have to carry for them, the archive helper, libarchive linked in
# statically (tools/package/libarchive.sh, ADR-041), and the media helper,
# GStreamer in the bundle's Frameworks (tools/package/gstreamer.py,
# ADR-076). Those that link another (Poppler, MuPDF, DjVuLibre) wait for
# their libraries; skwir says the engine is not installed. Their notices
# are tools/package/notices/macos.
skwir
skwir-pdf-worker
skwir-djvu-worker
skwir-model-worker
skwir-module-worker
skwir-archive-worker
skwir-media-worker
